# Day 4 - Stock Desk Project

# Project Overview
This project expands on the Stock Desk simulation by adding closing reconciliation logic and validation reports. It manages inventory, sales, restocks, and returns using guarded functions to maintain absolute state accuracy.

# Input Assumptions
- All input quantities and prices are valid non-negative integers.
- Unit prices stay constant throughout the operating shift.
- System state (stock, sold units, sales revenue) updates only when transactions are explicitly accepted.

# How to Run
Run the script using Node.js in your terminal:
bash
node day4/stock-desk.js
